## Knowledge Store — migrate document management from UC Volumes to Lakebase

Context: Domain document management previously uploaded files, parsed them with
`ai_parse_document`, and copied both the original binary and a `_parsed` sidecar
into a Unity Catalog Volume. This change keeps the parsing step but stops
storing the original document anywhere: only the parsed text is persisted, in
Lakebase Postgres (`domain_documents`). The feature is renamed from
"Document Management" to "Knowledge Store". Users can now view the parsed
content in-app, upload new files (hard 10 MB per-file cap), and purge one or
several parsed documents at once. `ai_parse_document` is now invoked with inline
base64 (`unbase64(...)`) so no UC Volume — and no `READ VOLUME`/`WRITE VOLUME`
grant — is required. The registry UC Volume is removed end-to-end from settings,
the deploy pipeline (DAB + app.yaml), health probes, and the MCP server.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/registry/store/lakebase/schema.sql
   Added `domain_documents` table (FK cascade on domain, UNIQUE(domain_id, version, filename), status CHECK).
2. src/back/objects/registry/store/lakebase/store.py
   Implemented the document store API (upsert/list/get/read text/read bytes/ready/failed/pending/delete/copy/count) with list queries that never select parsed_text/source_bytes.
3. src/back/objects/registry/store/base.py
   Added `DocumentRow` TypedDict and non-abstract default document methods on the store ABC.
4. src/back/core/databricks/DocumentExtractor.py
   Replaced Volume-path extraction with `extract_from_bytes()` — inline base64 `ai_parse_document(unbase64(...), map('version','2.0'))`.
5. src/back/core/databricks/DocumentParseService.py
   Rewrote the service on the store: 10 MB cap, async parse of pending rows, retry, read, list (parse_status), count, multi-delete; removed ParseManifest.
6. src/back/core/databricks/__init__.py
   Dropped ParseManifest from the package facade.
7. src/api/routers/internal/domain.py
   Repointed the document routes to the store: 10 MB guard on upload, multi-filename purge, parsed-text-only preview.
8. src/back/objects/ontology/GenerateWorkflow.py
   `list_ready_document_manifests` now reads ready rows from the Lakebase store.
9. src/back/objects/mapping/Mapping.py
   `fetch_documents_for_agent` reads parsed text from the store instead of a Volume.
10. src/agents/tools/documents.py
    `list_documents`/`read_document` tools read the Lakebase Knowledge Store (removed requests/User-Agent/VolumeFileService).
11. src/back/objects/domain/Domain.py
    Replaced `get_documents_volume_path`/`count_documents_in_volume` with `count_documents(settings)` over the store.
12. src/back/objects/domain/HomeService.py
    Uses `Domain.count_documents`.
13. src/back/objects/registry/RegistryService.py
    Version copy carries parsed text via the store; delete_version purges version doc rows; removed dead path/marker builders.
14. src/front/config/menu_config.json
    Renamed the "Documents" nav item to "Knowledge Store" (id unchanged).
15. src/front/templates/partials/domain/_domain_documents.html
    Knowledge Store heading, "max 10 MB per file", "Parsed Documents" card, multi-select purge control.
16. src/front/static/domain/js/domain-documents.js
    10 MB client guard, multi-select + select-all, purgeSelected(), parsed-content preview.
17. src/front/static/global/js/utils.js
    DocumentPreview now always fetches parsed-text JSON (removed binary/pdf/image branches).
18. src/front/templates/partials/ontology/_ontology_wizard.html, src/front/static/ontology/js/ontology-wizard.js
    Generate wizard wording: "Knowledge Store" (heading, subtitle, deep link).
19. src/shared/config/settings.py
    Removed `registry_volume`/`registry_volume_path` settings (kept catalog/schema).
20. src/shared/fastapi/health.py
    Removed the registry UC Volume read/write probes and relaxed the registry cfg probe to catalog/schema.
21. src/mcp-server/server/session.py, src/mcp-server/server/factory.py
    Stopped resolving REGISTRY_VOLUME_PATH/REGISTRY_VOLUME.
22. src/back/objects/domain/SettingsService.py, src/back/objects/registry/scheduler.py
    Dropped volume-based registry lock/creds resolution; scheduler emits the sentinel volume name.
23. databricks.yml, app.yaml.template
    Removed the UC Volume resource binding and `registry_volume` variable from both apps.
24. scripts/deploy.sh, scripts/deploy.config.sh, scripts/update-deployed-app.sh, scripts/_internal/check-deploy-prerequisites.sh
    Removed the volume FQN, `--var=registry_volume`, `databricks volumes read` preflight, and volume verification.
25. tests/fixtures/factories/registry/fake_document_store.py (+ __init__)
    Added an in-memory FakeDocumentStore reference implementation for the document API.
26. tests/units/** (registry/api/core/domain/mapping/agents/front/settings/config)
    Added/rewrote contract, service, route, consumer, UI, settings, and config-guard tests; removed obsolete Volume/User-Agent document tests.
27. src/front/templates/partials/settings/_settings_health.html
    Dropped the UC Volume read/write rows from the health copy.

